  "variant_semantics": [
    "Model.variants is an optional object map: variant name -> configuration object",
    "every observed body is purely a reasoning configuration",
    "OpenCode Zen and xAI-family: {\"reasoningEffort\": \"...\"} (optionally reasoningSummary/include)",
    "Google: {\"thinkingConfig\": {\"includeThoughts\": true, \"thinkingLevel\": \"...\"}}",
    "MADR 0112 A14 therefore maps variant keys onto picker.Option.ThinkingLevels",
    "\"default\" is the reserved sentinel meaning no variant override and is never sent upstream"
  ],
